{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/master...3e8bec7871bae6722f8f615020374c1b53de7b56","html_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/master...3e8bec7871bae6722f8f615020374c1b53de7b56","permalink_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/FFmpeg:4b0fad0...FFmpeg:3e8bec7","diff_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/master...3e8bec7871bae6722f8f615020374c1b53de7b56.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/compare/master...3e8bec7871bae6722f8f615020374c1b53de7b56.patch","base_commit":{"sha":"4b0fad0c61a9ba93e7bc8a469dac8ff208a45d7b","node_id":"C_kwDOABiiStoAKDRiMGZhZDBjNjFhOWJhOTNlN2JjOGE0NjlkYWM4ZmYyMDhhNDVkN2I","commit":{"author":{"name":"Baptiste Coudurier","email":"baptiste.coudurier@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-12T21:40:38Z"},"committer":{"name":"Baptiste Coudurier","email":"baptiste.coudurier@gmail.com","date":"2026-11-12T22:28:14Z"},"message":"avcodec/svq1dec: set the key flag on intra frames\n\nIntra frames are self-contained and were only marked as\nAV_PICTURE_TYPE_I, so every decoded SVQ1 frame had key_frame=0 and\nplayers waiting for a keyframe never showed the video.\n\nFixes #25938.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Baptiste Coudurier <baptiste.coudurier@gmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"257b6f81fc8886f5cab0425505aa3c88573f9326","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/git/trees/257b6f81fc8886f5cab0425505aa3c88573f9326"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/git/commits/4b0fad0c61a9ba93e7bc8a469dac8ff208a45d7b","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commits/4b0fad0c61a9ba93e7bc8a469dac8ff208a45d7b","html_url":"https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/4b0fad0c61a9ba93e7bc8a469dac8ff208a45d7b","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commits/4b0fad0c61a9ba93e7bc8a469dac8ff208a45d7b/comments","author":{"lo